    "description": "Page through the purchase orders released to one vendor, oldest first: poNumber, nodeId, state (ISSUED, ACK_PROCESSING, ACCEPTED, REJECTED, EXPIRED, SHIPMENT_PROCESSING, SHIPPED or CANCELLED), issuedAt, requiredShipBy, ackBy, the lines (lineNo, listingId, quantity) and, once they exist, the acknowledgement, the labels and the tracking numbers. Never a ship-to address, an orderId or a delivery promise. Narrow to one node (nodeId) or to orders issued after a moment (createdAfter, RFC 3339); pass the returned nextToken to get the next page, absent on the last one. Read-only; an unknown vendor fails with not-found, a malformed one with validation-failed, a node of another vendor with node-not-owned-by-vendor and a bad nextToken with validation-failed.",
